('thm:activation-bounded-column-switching','activation-bounded-theorem rank-step-correction','Keep conditional. Activation-bounded extension modifies G0 only and explicitly reuses G1–G6 of the two-tier theorem. It inherits that theorem’s corrected threshold and unresolved probability steps; the activation arithmetic does not establish the imported probability bound.'),
('thm:row-spread-column-switching','row-spread-theorem rank-step-correction','Keep conditional. Few-middle-label rank correction is 2^(3c+4) and N>=2^(3c+10)(c+1)log2 n. The many-label matched/satisfied bijection step has a separate probability gap. Valid rank tails or conditional decoder composition do not restore the full stated failure probability.'),
('thm:single-row-full-class-window','srf-theorem adaptive-rule-gap both-endpoints-rule','Keep conditional. The old adaptive-tree assertion was withdrawn; hole-only and both-endpoints conventions supply corrected deterministic query accounting, with the source’s role separation and loading qualifications. The independent newly audited probability product remains unsupported, so the final high-density statement is not reinstated or refuted.'),
('thm:pattern-bounded-switching','pattern-bounded-theorem','Keep conditional. Heavy-host matched-pair avoidance and later matched-light satisfaction use affected bijection probability arguments. The corrected rank step and host-counting statements retain separate scope; current-term composition can only turn a justified round bound into switching.'),
